    "346d0713-0773-4313-93de-8a0a299890f2": {
      "id": "346d0713-0773-4313-93de-8a0a299890f2",
      "message": {
        "author": {
          "name": null,
          "role": "assistant"
        },
        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "Based on everything you've been building with Luxora, I would not position the low-ticket offer as \"marketing\" or \"lead generation.\"\n\nThe biggest shift is:\n\n**People do not buy marketing.**\n**They buy certainty.**\n\nYour low-ticket funnel should help a med spa owner discover exactly where they're leaking money before they ever think about ads.\n\nThat aligns perfectly with the Luxora positioning you've been developing.\n\n# Luxora Value Ladder\n\n## Step 1: Low Ticket Offer ($27-$97)\n\n### Revenue Leak Audit\u2122\n\n**Price:** $47-$97\n\nWhat They Get:\n\n- Revenue Leak Score\n- KPI Calculator\n- Profit Between Appointments Calculator\n- No-Show Revenue Loss Calculator\n- Membership Opportunity Calculator\n- Retention Score\n- Staff Utilization Score\n- AI Follow-Up Score\n- Personalized Growth Report\n\nDeliverable:\n\n\"Discover the 7 Revenue Leaks Costing Your Med Spa $50,000-$250,000 Per Year\"\n\nThis is essentially a self-guided version of what you do manually.\n\n### Why It Works\n\nEvery owner wants more leads.\n\nFew realize they're leaking money before new leads even matter.\n\nThis creates the problem awareness necessary for your bigger offer.\n\n---\n\n# Step 2: Immediate Order Bumps ($27-$97)\n\nThese should be things they can implement themselves.\n\n## Order Bump #1\n\n### The Med Spa KPI Dashboard\n\n$47\n\nIncludes:\n\n- Revenue tracker\n- Membership tracker\n- Provider utilization tracker\n- Marketing ROI tracker\n- Conversion tracker\n\n---\n\n## Order Bump #2\n\n### The Profit Between Appointments Framework\n\n$37\n\nShows:\n\n- How to increase client value\n- Package creation\n- Add-on systems\n- Treatment stacking\n- Rebooking framework\n\n---\n\n## Order Bump #3\n\n### The AI Follow-Up Templates\n\n$67\n\nIncludes:\n\n- Missed consult texts\n- Reactivation campaigns\n- Membership retention sequences\n- Review requests\n- Referral requests\n\n---\n\n# Step 3: One-Time Offer #1 ($197-$497)\n\n## Membership Growth Blueprint\n\n$297\n\nIncludes:\n\n- Membership structure\n- Pricing formulas\n- Benefits framework\n- Launch plan\n- Retention plan\n\nThis is one of the biggest problems you see repeatedly.\n\nMost memberships are weak.\n\n---\n\n# Step 4: One-Time Offer #2 ($497-$997)\n\n## The Med Spa Growth Playbook Vault\n\n$997\n\nIncludes:\n\n### Revenue\n\n- Membership Playbook\n- Package Playbook\n- Upsell Playbook\n\n### Marketing\n\n- Social Media Playbook\n- Offer Creation Playbook\n- Launch Playbook\n\n### Operations\n\n- Team Accountability\n- Provider Scorecards\n- SOP Templates\n\n### Sales\n\n- Consult Scripts\n- Objection Handling\n- Closing Framework\n\nEssentially a mini-Luxora.\n\n---\n\n# Where The Call Happens\n\nThis is where most funnels fail.\n\nThey try to sell the call too early.\n\nInstead:\n\nRevenue Leak Audit\n\u2193\nOrder Bumps\n\u2193\nMembership Blueprint\n\u2193\nPlaybook Vault\n\u2193\n\n### THEN:\n\n# \"Book Your Complimentary Growth Prescription Call\"\n\nNOT a sales call.\n\nNOT a strategy call.\n\nCall it:\n\n### Growth Prescription Session\u2122\n\nOn the thank you page:\n\n---\n\n\"Based on your Revenue Leak Audit results, our team can show you exactly where you're losing revenue and build a customized Growth Prescription.\"\n\nDuring this session we'll show you:\n\n\u2713 Hidden revenue opportunities\n\n\u2713 Profit leaking from your patient journey\n\n\u2713 Membership opportunities\n\n\u2713 Retention opportunities\n\n\u2713 Whether paid acquisition is even the right next step\n\n\u2713 What it would take to add another $20K-$100K/month\n\n---\n\nThis gets much higher booking rates because it feels like a continuation of the audit.\n\n---\n\n# High Ticket Offer\n\nAfter the Growth Prescription Call:\n\n## Luxora Growth Partnership\n\n$9,000-$15,000\n\n### Phase 1\n\nRevenue Leak Repair\n\n- Memberships\n- Packages\n- Pricing\n- Retention\n- Follow-up\n- Reactivation\n\n### Phase 2\n\nGrowth Infrastructure\n\n- CRM\n- Automation\n- AI\n- Tracking\n- Dashboards\n\n### Phase 3\n\nPatient Acquisition\n\n- Meta Ads\n- AI SDR\n- Lead Qualification\n- Appointment Booking\n\n### Phase 4\n\nScale\n\n- Team\n- SOPs\n- Expansion\n- Partnerships\n\n---\n\n### If I were rebuilding Luxora today:\n\n**$47 Revenue Leak Audit**\n\u2193\n**$37 KPI Dashboard**\n\u2193\n**$67 AI Follow-Up Templates**\n\u2193\n**$297 Membership Blueprint**\n\u2193\n**$997 Growth Playbook Vault**\n\u2193\n**Growth Prescription Call**\n\u2193\n**$9K-$15K Luxora Growth Partnership**\n\nThis is much closer to the Laurence-style funnel because people are buying tangible assets and diagnostics first, then earning the right to a conversation, then ascending into implementation. The call becomes a natural next step instead of a hard sell."
